    "DefaultText": "A copper bathtub with warm, steaming water. Perfect for a relaxing bath."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "advanced_copper_tools_copper_bathtub_warm_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_CopperBathtub_Warm_Placed_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Usage:</b> Take a warm bath to wash as clean as the river does, clear rashes and wolfsbane from your skin, and improve mood. Keep the fire above half heat for a Hot Bath instead: the same cleaning and mood, plus a genuine Stress reduction. Any bath leaves you wet, so dry off at a stove or brazier. Add more firewood to keep it hot longer."
  },
